他控制着附近所有的传送门。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"cc3e0f38ec64b22cc465eab0fc6145c463b0edd6185030fb06fc18ed285fe809","component":"ashes-urhrok","entry_revision_identity":"4152577a8228fd458aafc707cc3da809707299736894ffeb5bd3a6f239c289dd","logical_entry_identity":"24c267e329b4846608e776889d12d317baf98ea976993628a11c965f670c810a","normalized_path":"tome-ashes-urhrok.lua","source":"Reckless Strike","source_tag":"talent name","target":"舍身一击"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"ec09f4ab9eed4ece7f52d76b62a1d03a43be4204bc9ae91f50694b7258c8b7be","component":"ashes-urhrok","entry_revision_identity":"41a57f1bc61d39eb621df4a5aa0934e1066407d9d961f702606c7c9592871389","logical_entry_identity":"89e991854e533c5d9313e0f358db3b4e3bed9d906539ccf778fa8996461e0ebd","normalized_path":"tome-ashes-urhrok.lua","source":"#ORANGE##Source# shares some pain with #target#!#LAST#","source_tag":"delayedLogMessage","target":"#ORANGE##Source#与#target#共享痛苦！#LAST#"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"1e89e82ede8b6cf5971a0ef148c805d23f1fe7ce6487c3b2d5bd07f3fe79b519","component":"ashes-urhrok","entry_revision_identity":"421e6af01a0eb92bd98699400031ab84521cb5d3fb8154a8c640a879a5fa70ae","logical_entry_identity":"17e32cc4517cf3df18e7408b9268d6412d0fba7e9d7afa58390ef737de2fdece","normalized_path":"tome-ashes-urhrok.lua","source":"mutilator","source_tag":"entity name","target":"恶魔切割者"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"8d7c328f8541c12a8301c3f89bce12d6f4eb8d7c0dea65eb866a0542b1021601","component":"ashes-urhrok","entry_revision_identity":"4279aaafa6e60f5c73309c436de74d2648bc71cfc0ffe3865ed35fe352d65aa0","logical_entry_identity":"8483af74009d773567f5a514ef7a025ccdec8c368d7c4e17e9e90575a1607198","normalized_path":"tome-ashes-urhrok.lua","source":"Welcome to Tales of Maj'Eyal - #CRIMSON#Ashes of Urh'Rok","source_tag":"_t","target":"欢迎来到马基埃亚尔 - #CRIMSON#乌鲁洛克之烬"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"ff9090c4f778eeb5f82fe9c0e3c32701476e981e66d6e1c6e6f1fc03c56fdc36","component":"ashes-urhrok","entry_revision_identity":"427bb144b9a9992de06f982f346ae87d8af9ff928f046d22eb9909e2dd7a5002","logical_entry_identity":"aa1df4b7c4cf5f99770da9eccc483ac0246574e6bbc660e3e9016683c0872227","normalized_path":"tome-ashes-urhrok.lua","source":"A small demon, he looks alarmed at your seeming freedom.","source_tag":"_t","target":"一个小恶魔，他对你的自由感到非常惊惶。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"7666b900fb2af8e2d740db5bf0953913e3e3974f9fe3732aa2eaf4791d4dd225","component":"ashes-urhrok","entry_revision_identity":"429bc83ee78f38083c20147d3a3fe3be18c166616ae0eef4803daf5b7998f756","logical_entry_identity":"2e775e1f9c102fdebdb8f2e8eb0015103eeddb904fc762b48d344d6f4fc8c4a9","normalized_path":"tome-ashes-urhrok.lua","source":"Cosmetic: demonic horns","source_tag":"_t","target":"外观：恶魔的角"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"8e622267d2d36ccf3e14983dbd0ff3fdd3f046fb0383587c41d7caee019a78b6","component":"ashes-urhrok","entry_revision_identity":"42def2fb86739cbbf5987c4993cef83d255ed0bdd314ab28d4670c4a3afcb7e5","logical_entry_identity":"cb153d1ad7e6cdf3833d757a5ae625b24b9e39848275106867b69d58264c68b4","normalized_path":"tome-ashes-urhrok.lua","source":"Demonic Tatoos 8","source_tag":"_t","target":"恶魔纹身8"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"64a5d0c728f44aa2e101e824f304fd5985a6c4e42047824a0bb2686e389603a9","component":"ashes-urhrok","entry_revision_identity":"43134b3daeeadebcfd1217a934c0c39557788de65ac2b81370f384c7e4a91b1d","logical_entry_identity":"54cc3449a6d224d83c9dfef0e4e640f614046d94d25048cd08bf57b9beb5238b","normalized_path":"tome-ashes-urhrok.lua","source":"The onslaught of the Sher'Tul portals never truly stopped.  Magic still pours from them, threatening to do even more damage to our home; it would be completely destroyed by now, if not for our Father.  Part of his work to keep Mal'Rok structurally intact is to blow great gusts across the devastated land, forcing the ravenous flames back into the portal network from whence they came.  It would seem, though, that the flames took souvenirs with them; our scouting parties have noted that Sher'Tul portals on Eyal, even those which have been completely deactivated, will occasionally emit a shade of one of our fallen citizens, imbued by some of Urh'Rok's power, smelling of Mal'Rok's ashes, and warped to insanity by its transit through the unstable rifts.  While this is a troubling revalation of the true horror of the Sher'Tul weapons, telling us that even now our fallen cannot rest in peace, the fact that they are arriving on Eyal in defiance of the shield is some consolation, as it means that those most wronged by the betrayal can claim their revenge personally.","source_tag":"_t","target":"夏·图尔传送门的影响从未停止。直到现在，奥术能量仍然在从中向外散溢而出，威胁着对我们的故乡做出更大的破坏；如果不是我们父亲大人的能力，恐怕我们的故乡早已经被其完全毁坏。他保持玛·洛克结构稳定的一个重要过程是在荒芜的土地上吹起狂暴的怒风，将饥渴的热焰吹回传送门的网络之中。然而，我们发现，这些烈火即使走时也要从我们的故乡掠夺些东西才肯返回。我们的埃亚尔探险队记录了在埃亚尔发现的夏·图尔传送门附近经常徘徊着我们牺牲同胞的灵魂——即使是那些已经关闭的传送门也不例外。他们被乌鲁洛克的力量所浸染，被玛·洛克的灰烬所环绕，在穿梭时空裂缝的过程中被折磨地几近疯狂。这昭示着有关夏·图尔人邪恶武器的恐怖力量，告诉我们即使是那些逝者在他们的折磨下也不得安眠。然而，他们绕过环绕埃亚尔的护盾到达星球表面的事实也给我们带来了些许慰藉，这些在夏·图尔人阴毒背叛的惨剧中受害的无辜者终于有机会亲自复仇了。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"0eb39fb2eabb381508e88826738c92a1bbd2b8fe172ca11ecca138ed83c5a85b","component":"ashes-urhrok","entry_revision_identity":"435ca9b7490f81665c6737895a47d51412850a38267b937e5f24a942e94049ff","logical_entry_identity":"a39e76dfe10ade1e89e33e89e525fe7828ed8d7dbaadd1ee564f776a65ddc598","normalized_path":"tome-ashes-urhrok.lua","source":"Your connection to fire nourishes you. Whenever you strike an enemy in melee, you inflict a burning curse upon them. As long as they continue to burn, you gain %0.2f health and %0.2f vim per turn.\n\t\tEach turn they remain within 10 spaces of you, all enemies with cursed flames will spread it to other burning enemies in radius 1, causing you to heal for the same amount for each enemy, as well as dealing %d fire damage on spreading.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"恶魔之火滋养着你。每当你的近战攻击命中敌人，便会对其施加诅咒之焰。每个受到诅咒之焰影响的敌人只要仍在燃烧，每回合都会为你恢复 %0.2f 点生命值并提供 %0.2f 点活力值。\n\t每回合，你半径 10 内每个受到诅咒之焰影响的敌人都有 50%% 几率，将诅咒传播给其半径 1 内尚未受诅咒的敌人，无论后者此前是否在燃烧。新受诅咒的敌人在持续燃烧期间，也会每回合为你恢复同等生命值并提供同等活力值。传播还会造成总计 %d 点火焰伤害，其中一半立即造成，另一半在接下来的 3 回合内造成。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"aa6ad5cb7be23f0882e06fc3ccd47b3337384f81aade314d4caaa0f6f2db1959","component":"ashes-urhrok","entry_revision_identity":"43a0566928bcaccd5a7e03c739681996f21d946ff9294d1b75b15da7ec2b6388","logical_entry_identity":"232a296698a9ee015c7bcbd002b9747081a22f38998a644d2b00ad5cde91f819","normalized_path":"tome-ashes-urhrok.lua","source":"#Target# imbues its weapon with demonic fire.","source_tag":"_t","target":"#Target#用恶魔之火给武器附魔。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"0d16d1291ff70f299015a0b3776fda0072505e050ed6f60ea1f55dddc483f6cb","component":"ashes-urhrok","entry_revision_identity":"43d7f25f9325e13a49f148768ee4501e13789eaa15b726b95d75d169bbb94404","logical_entry_identity":"adc973c32e70206e24982a7def40f9513c8bcb94ed031c5971224fad9e408355","normalized_path":"tome-ashes-urhrok.lua","source":"second mural painting","source_tag":"_t","target":"第二幅壁画"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"82fb1c3ccc9fb3fcd34b1cab626c063968e16dc777f266ba6340d0b321bee38e","component":"ashes-urhrok","entry_revision_identity":"4426bcf879880133fd845652279433d563c4b342802c4112b59e4d0defb8f102","logical_entry_identity":"69be0ac3cff482cdc3924b462e52bbaac5eb7da329c59feb782ebd21e0fa967d","normalized_path":"tome-ashes-urhrok.lua","source":"#CRIMSON#The power of the Fearscape touches %s and fades away, leaving a strange effect upon you.","source_tag":"logPlayer","target":"#CRIMSON#恶魔空间的力量触及了%s，然后消褪了，留下一个奇怪的效果。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"01ccff35668a3b775ab89b0b1c659fb2aa1728f2dd584b86007088f620f3f7b2","component":"ashes-urhrok","entry_revision_identity":"447e320af8ca13ad82cc229f108c811af67e2efd9353a73e80c75f2eeb0e4dfd","logical_entry_identity":"f6bec74cd89ac36d8759a36e272401c055996fc9e8ff4161885b0bdb600aeba9","normalized_path":"tome-ashes-urhrok.lua","source":"enthralled %s","source_tag":"tformat","target":"被奴役的 %s"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"dc1b9